# Frontend Conventions

## Structure

- All JS lives inline in `public/index.html` — no separate JS files
- Styles in `public/style.css`; dark mode via `prefers-color-scheme`
- Mobile-first layout

## State & Rendering

- `myName` from `localStorage` (`pp-name`); `slots` from SSE + `/api/today` polling (5s)
- `applySlots()` dedupes JSON before re-render; poll on load, interval, tab visible, SSE error
- `EventSource('/api/events')` handles `message`, `notify`, and `clear` events
- Past slots get `.past` class and are not clickable

## Slot Styling Classes

- `.mine` — user is in this slot
- `.match` — 2+ people (green)
- `.past` — slot time has passed

## API Usage

- `POST /api/register` on name save (duplicate-name warning)
- `POST /api/toggle` with `{ name, slot }` on slot tap
- Name maxlength 12 (matches server validation)
